<p>Shabihe payamber akber nouha kare maa<br />
Shaah ka dilbar akber nouha kare maa</p>

<p>Armaan bohot tha mai teri shaadi rachaau<br />
Ek roz dulhan chaand si mai byaah ke laau<br />
 Par laash pa roti hai teri kokh jali maa</p>

<p>Zinda the tumhe dekh ke ab kaise jienge<br />
Soncha tha tere byaah ki poshak siyenge<br />
 Par tujh ko kafan bhi na mila haaye meri jaa'n</p>

<p>Bimaar behen takti hai beta tera rasta<br />
pardes me aaye to raha yaad na waada<br />
 Maqtal kiya aabaad madina kiya veeraa'n</p>

<p>Rothi hai phupi jis ne tuhjhe laad se paala<br />
Tum kya gaye ruqsat hua is ghar ka ujaala<br />
 Ek baap zaeefi me hua be saro saamaa'n</p>

<p>Allah nigehbaan tumhara mere pyare<br />
Hum log rasan basta hue shaam sidhaare<br />
 Sota hai tere sath yahaa'n asghare naadaa'n<br />
</p>